    "detail": "Instructions:\n1. Install One ROM 24 in U2 socket\n2. Use Jumpers A (1) + B (2) as required, 0 = NTSC Fire Skip (recommended), 1 = PAL Fire Skip (recommended), 2 = NTSC No Delay, 3 = NTSC Short Delay\n3. Power on the console and enjoy!",
